Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:41.65,形影不离chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\be1\fad(500,500)\t(0,10000,\1a&HFF)}{\move(960,100.5,960,120)}前路光明無限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用去和大叔和早苗阿姨打聲招呼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛才的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸以前當過演員
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:13.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在高中時代作為學生演員就已經小有名氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像還在比賽中獲得過優勝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一點也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:24.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽說過的只是 媽媽曾經擔任過中學教師
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:34.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照片裡的兩人看起來十分幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:36.71,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為他們實現了自己的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:37.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:41.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且 本該能一直持續下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:44.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是沒有我的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:45.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:48.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他們兩人現在也應該是十分幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:52.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但卻放棄了夢想 不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:57.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後我現在犧牲了他們的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卻想要去實現自己的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:05.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是個很過分的孩子 一點都不懂得感恩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我對岡崎同學也是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:13.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了實現自己的夢想 浪費了大家很多的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們是因為自己喜歡所以才做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:18.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你現在就這麼氣餒了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:21.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我們所做的一切就會變得毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家好不容易拼到這一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:26.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.99,0:03:52.58,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好睏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.56,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是沒有一點緊張感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚 你怎麼了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:04:00.45,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚在正式表演之前都會緊張的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:01.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:02.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.91,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚看起來是不是有點奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:07.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為發生了一些事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:09.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你照平時的樣子做就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.24,0:04:16.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚 讓我來告訴你一個很不錯的魔咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:19.51,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在手上寫三次字並吞下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.24,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人 人 人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:24.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是「人」 而是「入」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:26.13,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心意才是最重要的吧！心意！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:29.27,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陽平 不會寫漢字的話不用勉強哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這種程度的怎麼可能不會寫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:31.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又來了 又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:33.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太把我當傻瓜看了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:36.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正要到下午才正式演出 稍微出去走走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:38.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對了 我必須去陪我妹妹才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:41.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 在那之前就先自由活動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:44.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 你想去哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:47.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:50.36,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 你在說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:56.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 雖然我心裡明白我必須得振作才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:59.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但總是不由自主地想起很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像岡崎同學說的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:06.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}畢竟是大家一起建成的舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:10.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能因為我而讓大家的努力白費
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:14.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 好好做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:15.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:41.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那傢伙跑哪兒去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 早苗阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.40,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大叔沒跟你在一起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:52.47,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他讓我先過來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:54.53,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他會過來看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:58.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題的 他絕不可能會錯過渚的演出的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她全都知道了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:06.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到的時候 已經來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個… 我們走散了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:12.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.62,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}古河小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.49,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 磯貝女士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:18.85,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我就先告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:21.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚就拜託你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:39.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.97,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 古河同學 有什麼事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:46.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:52.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我之前從岡崎同學那裡聽說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:56.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說是這裡收藏著高中演劇的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:01.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要作為表演的參考嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:02.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:05.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很期待下午的演出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:08.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去外面隨便走走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:15.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}資料跟錄像就請隨便看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:22.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高中演劇大賽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:18.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:25.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宮澤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:28.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 岡崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:29.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有看到渚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}古河同學的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:34.83,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在資料室查閱以前高中演劇的資料…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:38.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是 大叔的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:08:00.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是爸爸高中時代的錄像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:04.50,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在演劇大賽中獲得優勝時的錄像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就連阿波羅也捨棄了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:11.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不論是我自己還是我王國的子民
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:13.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都已經成為了招致腐朽的不幸象徵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:15.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:18.01,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:21.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明和我一樣都是高中三年級的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:24.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我跟他根本無法相提並論
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:33.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我們想讓部長古河君發表一下優勝感言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:35.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:41.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡演戲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今後一生都要站在舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.68,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要成為職業演員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:49.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就藉此機會宣誓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 您自己的抱負就先談到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請作為社團的代表 說一句吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演戲真是太棒…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:01.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:04.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在盡你所能去做就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:05.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:22.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以上是合唱部的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.86,0:09:26.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下來是演劇部的獨角戲「幻想物語」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:30.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}腳本和主演 古河渚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}準備需要少許的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:47.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:49.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}終於到這個時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:52.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題的 一定會成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要像練習時那樣去演 一定可以演好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:58.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用太緊張了 放輕鬆去演就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:13.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:16.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演劇部的「幻想物語」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚 開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:43.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道 想知道然後去道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:46.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:48.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:50.63,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我幫你借到個好東西了哦 看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:53.15,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有點奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:56.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歡迎回家 我們愛的結晶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:58.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:00.16,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太緊張了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.81,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小渚的樣子好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:07.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是怯場了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:08.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎 要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:10.30,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要先把幕降下來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:13.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是她的話 一定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(0,300)}我喜歡演戲
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}我喜歡演戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.51,0:11:22.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}我今後一生都要站在舞台上
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.87,0:11:25.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}我今後一生都要站在舞台上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.70,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}一定要成為職業演員 我就藉此…
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.61,0:11:30.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}一定要成為職業演員 我就藉此…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:32.12,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}一定要成為職業演員 我就藉此…
Dialogue: 2,0:11:32.05,0:11:33.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}演戲真是太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.86,0:11:35.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}演戲真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:37.72,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}演戲真是太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.78,0:11:41.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(300,300)}演戲真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表演已經開始了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道是真的哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行了 把幕降下來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.15,0:12:05.92,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:23.17,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去實現夢想吧 渚！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:26.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:31.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是笨蛋嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:34.04,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子的夢想就是父母的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:35.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由你去實現就行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:39.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們夢想著你能實現自己的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:42.32,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們並沒有放棄自己的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:45.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是把自己的夢想寄託在了你的夢想上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:47.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所謂父母就是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:50.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所謂家族就是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 從那天開始就一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.67,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}過著烤麵包的生活 一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:59.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們一直都在渴望著這一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.59,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果在這裡你氣餒了 我們會很失落的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:05.09,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.41,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}責任重大啊 你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗 你在的吧 你也說兩句
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:14.75,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼回事 發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.60,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.84,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們也是 渚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:27.35,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和春原沒能做到的事情 你現在正要去實現
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:31.64,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你現在背負著我們充滿了挫折的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:05.77,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:09.02,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓我帶您去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:14.96,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這座小鎮 願望實現的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:17.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帶我們去吧 渚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:19.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.79,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡是已經終結了的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:27.11,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了我以外 別無他人的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:31.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房間裡有的只是小小的木製桌椅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:35.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗外是一片一望無垠的荒野
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:41.86,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}古舊的建築 連是什麼時候造的都無從知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我獨自一人生活在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:50.25,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有時候會外出 撿一些必要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使來到外面也是 獨自一人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:15:01.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在微弱的陽光中 有無數微弱的光在飛舞著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:07.99,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我撿起了樹枝和釘子 還有許許多多東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:10.18,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為的是做出朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:14.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是誕生於這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:16.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對他來說 是一件幸福的事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:20.65,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個疑問一直留在我的心中…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:28.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個世界果然早已終結
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.90,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會再誕生新的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.82,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有生命的物體 除了她以外不會再有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很久很久以前 或者是很遠很遠的將來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.26,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我存在於一個不同的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那裡是一個非常熱鬧的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:46.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但現在已經回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:50.14,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我擁有她為我製造的這具身體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.29,0:15:53.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:57.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還要做嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.21,0:16:00.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:02.98,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會動的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:06.10,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能變成朋友的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:11.78,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要做其他的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:15.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.52,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:24.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是她能把破爛組合起來 製作出什麼新的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.89,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是我不能做到的很特別的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:33.20,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 只要去花費一點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:36.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說不定會做出什麼好東西的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.73,0:16:41.21,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做點什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:51.22,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像這樣令人歡心雀躍的東西就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:54.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她來做 我幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是一件很美妙的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:59.69,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想待在她身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今後也一直兩個人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:06.31,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後 在某一天離開這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:11.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前往我曾存在過的那個既溫暖又熱鬧的世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:28.94,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想起下文來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:31.54,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}故事的下文
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:36.55,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女孩和人偶決定離開那個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.95,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為人偶知道在遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一個比那裡更加溫暖和熱鬧的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.29,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後呢 怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.57,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}經過長長的旅行後
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:49.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那遠方…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:50.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那遠方？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.61,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唱起了歌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:54.43,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:55.73,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:59.76,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我剛才在表演最後唱的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.23,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是和故事對應起來的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:06.34,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那個女孩怎麼說也不會去唱「糰子大家族」的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.39,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我的個人興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.28,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然大家都報以熱烈的掌聲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.74,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但最後的氣氛始終有點微妙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎把之前的感動都破壞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.93,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我無論如何都想唱嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 這樣也好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:26.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}棒極了 你的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.33,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.05,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不會說客套話 你是知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:34.37,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 所以真的很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.42,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您也來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為收到了請帖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.66,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 擅自做了這樣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:50.88,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我想還是聯繫一下的比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:55.00,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到你的演出了 非常不錯的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:18:56.46,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:00.38,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓我想起了許許多多的往事…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:06.48,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我就此告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:07.44,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:10.87,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:19.07,chs for CL,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天要不要去哪裡玩玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:29.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好是補假 我們倆偶爾也單獨出去走走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:31.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且也有些話想對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:31.75,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有話？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.83,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 原來在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都在活動室等著你們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:38.73,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主角和導演不在的話 沒辦法開始慶祝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:39.91,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:41.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:42.70,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不經過允許 擅自進來真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:11.41,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什麼關係 畢竟我們是這裡的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:12.72,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:16.98,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這段時間…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:21.84,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這段時間我變得不怎麼討厭這所學校了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:24.89,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎 真太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來我是值日生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我在你病假時寫上去的 自己都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.63,0:20:35.91,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一點都沒注意到…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:51.88,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:21:00.50,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天我不是說有話要對你說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.56,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.03,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:12.91,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果在明天起來之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:16.53,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發現我們變成了一對戀人 你會覺得很有意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.61,0:21:25.83,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請和我交往 渚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:32.41,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 希望你以後一直都和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:46.68,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎同學今天好像要去春原同學那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:48.34,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:53.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近 想了很多有關你的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:54.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像很愉快嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.19,0:23:57.17,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能讓我也加入呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:59.72,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這裡沒別人的 沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.88,0:24:01.77,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 小子 你告訴她
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:03.35,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是笨蛋嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.79,0:24:06.62,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒辦法 只好我來說了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.79,0:24:08.62,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟糕 開始興奮了
